# Keep the FrankenPHP build context small and free of local build artifacts. The dev image never
# COPYs the app source (it's bind-mounted at runtime via `.:/app` in compose.yaml); the prod image
# (frankenphp/Dockerfile's app_builder stage) COPYs an explicit, minimal file list instead of relying
# on this file for that. What matters here: context-upload size, and keeping locally generated
# artifacts (compiled assets, downloaded vendor assets, caches) out of the image - they are rebuilt
# inside the image and must never be mixed with the local ones.
.git/
.github/
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.idea/
.dockerignore
.phpunit.cache/

**/*.log
**/*.md

coding-standard/
var/
vendor/
node_modules/
tests/
scripts/
Makefile
phpunit.xml*

# Generated by `asset-map:compile` / `importmap:install` / `assets:install`
public/assets/
public/bundles/
assets/vendor/

compose*.yaml
compose*.yml
Dockerfile
frankenphp/Dockerfile

.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.test
